  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br><br>Grove By The Sea - Passin' Thru<br><br><br><br>The Space:<br><br>Take your vacation to the next level at this colorful and bright getaway near the beach! This inviting home offers a true Florida cottage style and is conveniently equipped with comfortable furnishings throughout, a large patio at the entrance of the house, a spacious screened-in patio on the side of the house, and a fully-equipped kitchen to make cooking a breeze. Unwind in the living area and watch your favorite shows or take advantage of the shared swimming pool available.<br><br><br><br>What's nearby:<br><br>Beachgoers will fall in love with the location of this charming abode as it's only a short walk away from the white sands and emerald waters of the Gulf of Mexico. Find plenty of dining options as you stroll along Hwy 30A. The nearby Deer Lake State Park is a great place to visit if you're into outdoor activities. There you can take scenic hikes, bike, kayak, and paddleboard. Eastern Lake is less than two miles away and is a safe alternative to the Gulf for children; try your hand at paddleboarding, kayaking, and floating around in the lake.<br><br><br><br>Things to know:<br><br>Full kitchen<br><br>Free WiFi<br><br>Up to four bikes available for guest use<br><br>*",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Colorful house near the beach with shared swimming pool"
        }
      ],
